  "details": "I would like to request a feature that allows users to control their Online / Ask Me status visibility on a per-friend or per-group basis.\n\nCurrently, the status setting applies globally to all friends. However, it would be very useful if users could configure this more granularly.\n\nSpecifically, the following functionality would be helpful:\n\n1.The ability to control whether a specific friend sees the user as Online or Ask Me.\n\n2.Since friends can be organized into groups, the ability to set Online / Ask Me visibility per group.\n\nThis feature would allow users to manage their availability more flexibly. For example, users could appear Online to close friends while appearing as Ask Me to others.\n\nIt would improve privacy and make social interactions more comfortable within VRChat.\n\nThank you for considering this request.",
